From: FractalCR <build@fractalcr.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] runtime: prepare factory sandbox staging directory without shared fs

CLH does not create a shared filesystem directory when shared_fs is none.
VM assignment still links the sandbox staging directory to that path; ensure
the target exists so filesystem preparation does not encounter a dangling link.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 src/runtime/virtcontainers/vm.go | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/runtime/virtcontainers/vm.go b/src/runtime/virtcontainers/vm.go
--- a/src/runtime/virtcontainers/vm.go
+++ b/src/runtime/virtcontainers/vm.go
@@ -352,6 +352,10 @@ func (v *VM) assignSandbox(s *Sandbox) error {
 	os.RemoveAll(sbSharePath)
 	os.RemoveAll(sbSockDir)
 
+	if err := os.MkdirAll(vmSharePath, DirMode); err != nil {
+		return err
+	}
+
 	if err := os.Symlink(vmSharePath, sbSharePath); err != nil {
 		return err
 	}
